{"synopsis":"Oleh penulis yang mengerjakan Ending Maker! \nDan dibawa oleh Redice Studio yang menegrjakan Revenge of the Iron-Blooded Sword Hound, Solo Leveling, Reaper of the Drifting Moon, dan banyak lagi!\n\nJoo In-gong terseret masuk ke dalam remake dari game yang sedang ia mainkan, <Knight Saga:Re>.\n\nNamun, ada sesuatu yang janggal. Seharusnya hanya ada dua karakter yang bisa dimainkan—Loch dari pihak manusia, dan Zephyr dari pihak iblis. \n\nTapi entah bagaimana, ia justru terbangun dalam tubuh Shutra—pangeran kesembilan dari Dunia Iblis, sosok yang sebenarnya bahkan tidak pernah ada dalam cerita asli game itu.\n\nDianugerahi dua kekuatan misterius, \"Pengaturan Ulang Karakter Protagonis\" dan \"Kekuatan Penaklukan,\" \nJoo In-gong kini harus mengubah alur cerita game demi bertahan hidup melawan Zephyr.\n\nNamun, setiap kali jalan cerita berubah... perhatian semakin banyak tertuju padanya.","alternative_title":"브레이커즈","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"f8188f9e-5cdc-440a-81c5-287e8be2984c","number":"80","chapter":"80","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f4773717-68e6-4774-a026-add3e43bce43","number":"79","chapter":"79","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c52b2f51-10c6-4884-a32f-e2c060bbfd29","number":"78","chapter":"78","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"98890438-1563-4502-8fd8-a01738b1f1fe","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a1a65f2d-6a6c-4bbd-bd24-b051deef6ae5","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2026-04-29","released":"2026-04-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"22c42c8c-2ed6-4b2f-a067-941aab11025f","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2026-04-29","released":"2026-04-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"121cafe4-4c68-45da-be54-19b2dc06d